  {
    "id": 1017002010010,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "平気っす！\r\nお仕事、楽しいっすから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700201/1017002010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017002010020,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "今日は何をするっすか？\r\nステージ出るっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700201/1017002010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……今日はバラエティの収録だ\r\n大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017002010030,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "もちろん、どんとこいっす！\r\n芸人さんとかタレントさん、みんな面白いっすもん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700201/1017002010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、頼もしい限りだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017002010040,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "はいっす！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700201/1017002010040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "think1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1017002010050,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "……わたし、面白そうなこと探して、\r\n色んなことしてきたっすけど……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700201/1017002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017002010060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "アイドルはなんか違うんす\r\nキラキラしてて、キラキラがいつまでも消えなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700201/1017002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017002010070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "それって、プロデューサーさんがいるからっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700201/1017002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017002010080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "だから、もっと色んなお仕事持ってきてほしいっす！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700201/1017002010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、やる気いっぱいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017002010090,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "満タンっすよ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp4",
